# Styling & Design System

**Entry point:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) · **Source:** `docs/plans/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` · **Import:** `@/design-system`

## Tokens & primitives

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — inline colors in screens/features
backgroundColor: '#F6F2E8'

// ✅ GOOD
import { colors, space, Text, Button, Stack } from '@/design-system';
backgroundColor: colors.background
```

- Use `colors`, `space`, `radius` tokens — not inline hex/rgba in `client/app/**` or `client/src/features/**`
- Use `<Text variant="…" />` for typography — not raw `fontSize`/`fontFamily` for styled copy
- Layout: `Stack`, `Row`, `Rule` for spacing and section breaks
- `src/theme.ts` was deleted in Phase 2; do not recreate it

## Constants

Animation durations and defaults live in `src/constants.ts`, not inline.

## Design rules

- **No shadows, no gradients** — see `design-system.mdc`
- **Midnight Wire aesthetic** — light dossier, ruled lines, olive accent for active states only
- **StyleSheet.create** for layout; push visual styling into primitives where possible
- **No emojis in UI** — SVG avatars via `<Avatar />`
